// Cisco Local Accounts | T1098, T1136.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/network/cisco/aaa/cisco_cli_local_accounts.yml
*username* OR *aaa*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "*username* OR *aaa*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
